    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Beyond The Heavens is a arcade style shoot-em-up where you take control of a ship seeking to reach the destination that calls out to it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The journey will take place across several worlds including Heaven and Hell!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Upgrade ship and weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Various ship skins </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Change your ship weapon load-out from 4 unique weapons </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Super Laser that clears bullets and enemies </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Ultra AOE that unleashes energy collected from fallen enemies to clear the screen of all bullets and enemies  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Original soundtrack that can be listened to at leisure via the in-game <strong>Jukebox</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 11 Unique levels each with their own hazards and enemy patterns</p></li></ul>",
